docs {
  Returns the full "referred student detail" view — student profile, admissions
  progress timeline, fees cleared, academic details, and commission/payout status.
  Requires: blink_employee access token.
  
  Returns 404 if the referral does not exist or does not belong to this employee.
  
  Response shape (referral block):
  {
    ...student fields...,
    "referral": {
      "id": "RFL-...",
      "status": "enrolled",
      "currentStatus": "enrolled",        // live ApplicationCourse.status
      "timeline": [
        { "label": "Referral link shared", "at": "..." },
        { "label": "Application completed", "at": "..." },
        ...
      ],
      "fees": { "items": [...], "totalCleared": 10000 },
      "academicDetails": { "courseName": "...", "collegeName": "...", "intake": "2024-25", "studyMode": "full_time" } | null,
      "commission": { "id": "...", "netPayout": 500, "status": "credited", "payoutDueDate": "...", "paidAt": null } | null
    }
  }
  
  academicDetails/commission are null until the referral has a linked application/
  commission respectively. timeline stops at whatever the current application
  status is — no future steps fabricated.
  
  Tables: referrals, students, commissions, application_courses, application_status_logs,
          student_fee_ledger, transactions, courses, colleges, admission_cycles
}
